                                "sense_id": "ef135597-7802-3252-9ab8-c7a2c383a8db",
                                "text": "At Mainz we discovered a café close to the theatre, and sipped coffee and ate Streuselkuchen out of doors in the shadow of the cathedral and Gutenberg's statue."
